      ":question/worked-solution": "- $B$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 2, column 1 is $-8\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -8 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular: **true**. All entries above the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -8 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${B}^{T}$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 1, column 2 is $-8\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\n{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & -8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
