  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186119784,
      "id": "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54",
      "title": "Identifying Correct Statements About a Matrix"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -7 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $C$ is upper triangular: **true**. All entries below the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -7 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $C$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 1, column 4 is $-2\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -7 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- ${C}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 3, column 2 is $-4\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
      ":question/id": "f3674c3e-c372-5cbf-8c50-a6ad3e15a957",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "10221bc9-2936-5b83-8228-e296e363cb0f",
          ":answer-field/key": "$C$ is upper triangular.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
